the manifest — good for reproducibility. Let me include this in the analysis.\n\nMemory: 3 FASTAs of ~62-64 Mb characters — load as a single string per reference, ~190 MB total; no problem.\n\nPerformance: iterating over all VCF records (how many? 3.8 MB gzipped → probably ~40-60k variants) against 3 references — trivial.\n\nFirst, let me quickly check the FASTA header lines and count the number of VCF records. Then write the script."}}
